    <string name="error_service_not_enabled">Notification access needed</string>
    <string name="error_service_not_enabled_description">To control music from your watch, Svartifoss needs notification access — that\'s how Android lets it see which app is playing and send it play, pause and skip commands.\n\nSvartifoss never reads the contents of your notifications. It only uses this permission to find the active media session.\n\nTap \"Open Settings\", then turn on Svartifoss under notification access.</string>
